research/audit/wave9-dispatch/audit-refuter-a6-fs-additive-implies-linear.prompt.md:1227:- **The coefficient map is the source of the pathology.** $\Lambda_{b_{\star}}$ is additive ([[def-additive-function]]) and takes only rational values, so it is not of the form $x \mapsto cx$; that is the whole of [[fs-additive-implies-linear]], and the companion page reads off from it a function unbounded on every interval, with dense graph and dense level sets.
